```plantuml
@startuml
title Book Room - Activity Diagram

start

:Select room and booking time;
:Enter booking details;

:Check time range;

if (Time range valid?) then (yes)
  :Check blocked-room status;

  if (Room blocked?) then (yes)
    :Reject booking;
    stop
  else (no)
    :Check overlapping bookings;

    if (Booking overlaps?) then (yes)
      :Reject booking;
      stop
    else (no)
      :Create booking;
      :Show confirmation;

      stop
    endif
  endif

else (no)
  :Reject booking;
  stop
endif

@enduml
```
